Max[n,m] through n m; every vertex has a transverse neighbour\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"4088ba05-54e7-4bc1-ba6e-bbca712385ec"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "34db8986-f5ce-4c9a-866c-259303d5ccae"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<AtMostOneEdgeLift\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "11d517c1-2656-46a6-be96-5eae0ed5382f"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "6e8625ff-4e8f-443f-ba30-e270af4eb82f"], Cell[
    "1 through Min[n,m]; the edges form a matching", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"56af04aa-1b90-4f12-b715-c8444e7d3280"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "1226dff5-db9a-430b-bc90-6a611555b4bf"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<UniqueEdgeLifting\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "32b3a3ba-063f-4fbb-94d8-c43ad1d5d5b0"],
     ", or both ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Fibration\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "a050e18b-191f-4a2b-9e12-7f9935cb19a2"],
     " and ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<AtMostOneEdgeLift\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "e5d6ae52-01d3-4f09-9a17-690c3b092609"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"8313ad82-aee3-4a2f-9364-f7b591aae748"], 
    Cell["n, with n = m; a perfect matching", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "75fe76dd-a1a5-4825-a68e-0be9551dec25"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "b448e604-64e3-4403-8fd6-196a848500c1"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<FiberBundle\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "d66fb191-e8a0-4581-9b77-aadabfe6abb0"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "0fbc5a7f-67c3-404d-b589-a0fd9ea852a7"], Cell[
    "n, with n = m; the matching preserves fiber adjacency", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"4d6b4044-135b-4e0c-b6dc-21393097dcc6"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "b5ba682d-ce60-42cc-a120-6094d499884e"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Covering\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "04db8ba8-6660-48c5-972e-87aac67fdd13"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "870d227c-3154-4f4f-b825-c4242738a868"], Cell[
    "n, with n = m and no vertical edges", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "2a9dca98-e461-4d8b-aaaa-c1aaddf4a177"]}
  }]], "2ColumnTableMod",ExpressionUUID->"93178e4b-d2c8-4697-a28f-\
7997059dc9f3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5298a728-472d-4faf-bdef-571861c67f82"],
 " draws a feasible count and constructs edges satisfying the properties. ",
 Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5990e74d-f372-444d-9ce6-951b45897369"],
 " uses the complete join of adjacent fibers; it is accepted only when this \
satisfies every requested property. In particular, a complete join with \
unique lifting requires both adjacent fibers to be singletons."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"0b755728-8364-4b79-985a-a1643c7b5d29"]
}, Open  ]],

